x * y != z | x * u != z | u = y.
(x / y) * y = x.
(x * y) / y = x.
x * (x \ y) = y.
x \ (x * y) = y.
x * 1 = x.
1 * x = x.
a(x,a(y,z,u),w) = 1.

end_of_list.
